\section{Unified Autonomous Manifold Solver}

The USC-QSE-v5.2 unified solver is:
\begin{equation}
\mathcal{U}(t)
= \sigma K \Delta \mathbf{z}(t)
+ \Phi_{\sigma}(\mathbf{x}(t)),
\label{eq:unified_appendix}
